{"questions":[{"question":"Kva er formelen for trekanttal nr. $n$?","options":["$T_n = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$","$T_n = n^2$","$T_n = 2n$","$T_n = n + 1$"],"explanation":"$T_n = 1 + 2 + \\cdots + n = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$."},{"question":"Kva er $T_{10}$ (det 10. trekanttalet)?","options":["$55$","$45$","$66$","$50$"],"explanation":"$T_{10} = \\frac{10 \\cdot 11}{2} = 55$."},{"question":"Kva er formelen for femkanttal?","options":["$P_n = \\frac{n(3n - 1)}{2}$","$P_n = n^2$","$P_n = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$","$P_n = 5n$"],"explanation":"Femkanttal: $P_n = \\frac{n(3n - 1)}{2}$."},{"question":"For eit fyrstikkmønster $4, 7, 10, 13$, kva er formelen for figur $n$?","options":["$F_n = 3n + 1$","$F_n = 4n$","$F_n = 3n - 1$","$F_n = n + 3$"],"explanation":"Aritmetisk med $d = 3$, $a_1 = 4$: $F_n = 4 + (n-1) \\cdot 3 = 3n + 1$."},{"question":"Kva gir summen av to påfølgjande trekanttal, $T_{n-1} + T_n$?","options":["Eit kvadrattal $n^2$","Eit femkanttal","Eit primtal","Eit oddetal"],"explanation":"$T_{n-1} + T_n = n^2$, eit kvadrattal. T.d. $T_2 + T_3 = 3 + 6 = 9 = 3^2$."}],"_meta":{"sourceHash":"a6ef1bca57581d69","translatedAt":"2026-06-21T22:19:04.691Z","model":"claude-code-agent","strings":26,"tm":{"104538112e3bf960":"Kva er formelen for trekanttal nr. $n$?","f345211faee3edde":"$T_n = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$","7169e5720bf46e10":"$T_n = n^2$","ee7bf8debc35ac20":"$T_n = 2n$","5fff6fcbdeb8f41a":"$T_n = n + 1$","59f497160ba2d3c5":"$T_n = 1 + 2 + \\cdots + n = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$.","c93fcddaefbb8a04":"Kva er $T_{10}$ (det 10. trekanttalet)?","f9c9c1889f73bdfb":"$T_{10} = \\frac{10 \\cdot 11}{2} = 55$.","e61af6855f9f9fe6":"Kva er formelen for femkanttal?","e19a8d7c480fd0f0":"$P_n = \\frac{n(3n - 1)}{2}$","1b544736dac6512e":"$P_n = n^2$","1d576f1f88067756":"$P_n = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$","7fb30b692b9a7f95":"$P_n = 5n$","d4fb8852215794a1":"Femkanttal: $P_n = \\frac{n(3n - 1)}{2}$.","0736b33c2a2b2b9e":"For eit fyrstikkmønster $4, 7, 10, 13$, kva er formelen for figur $n$?","15089b148edea838":"$F_n = 3n + 1$","063c9a10f5697fb1":"$F_n = 4n$","ac36476a0926677f":"$F_n = 3n - 1$","4dd04d671e93837d":"$F_n = n + 3$","e1aa81e61bc2235e":"Aritmetisk med $d = 3$, $a_1 = 4$: $F_n = 4 + (n-1) \\cdot 3 = 3n + 1$.","60c8492ba74ba7c3":"Kva gir summen av to påfølgjande trekanttal, $T_{n-1} + T_n$?","09171be6c6e834f4":"Eit kvadrattal $n^2$","9209bbfc949e19d4":"Eit femkanttal","58c47e2aa2dcd556":"Eit primtal","1f03c0612ff38011":"Eit oddetal","58fee8ed4c6bcab3":"$T_{n-1} + T_n = n^2$, eit kvadrattal. T.d. $T_2 + T_3 = 3 + 6 = 9 = 3^2$."}}}